{"root":"susah","ipa":"/su.sah/","core":"困难的、难的、艰苦的；表示某事难以完成或处于困境中。","pos":["形容词"],"scenes":["高频","生活"],"rootBlock":{"ipa":"/su.sah/","zh":"困难的，难办的","phrases":[{"t":"susah payah","zh":"费尽周折，辛苦"},{"t":"susah hati","zh":"忧虑，难过"},{"t":"susah dimengerti","zh":"难以理解"}],"examples":[{"t":"Soal ujian ini sangat susah.","zh":"这道考试题非常难。"},{"t":"Jangan susah hati, semuanya akan baik-baik saja.","zh":"别难过，一切都会好起来的。"}]},"ders":[{"w":"susah","ipa":"/su.sah/","zh":"困难的","phrase":{"t":"hidup susah","zh":"生活艰苦"},"example":{"t":"Dia sedang susah sekarang.","zh":"他现在正处于困境中。"}},{"w":"menyusahkan","ipa":"/mə.ɲu.sa.kan/","zh":"使……困难，给……添麻烦","phrase":{"t":"menyusahkan orang lain","zh":"给别人添麻烦"},"example":{"t":"Jangan menyusahkan orang tua.","zh":"不要给父母添麻烦。"}},{"w":"kesusahan","ipa":"/kə.su.sa.han/","zh":"困难，困境，苦难","phrase":{"t":"mengalami kesusahan","zh":"遭遇困难"},"example":{"t":"Dia membantu saya saat saya dalam kesusahan.","zh":"我在困境中时他帮助了我。"}},{"w":"persusahan","ipa":"/pər.su.sa.han/","zh":"苦难，磨难（较少用）","phrase":{"t":"segala persusahan","zh":"一切苦难"},"example":{"t":"Dia telah melewati banyak persusahan hidup.","zh":"他已经历了许多生活的磨难。"}}],"derSlugs":["susah","menyusahkan","kesusahan","persusahan"],"model":"gemini-3.1-flash-lite","createdAt":"2026-09-26T16:06:53.121Z","src":"base"}